"US-0603: Releases or continuous deployment, and stories marked for a release (docs/features/epic-06-feature-docs.md). Each project chooses Releases or Continuous deployment; with Releases, stories can be marked for a release from the app and a release list shows planned and tagged releases; with Continuous deployment, a story ends at Deployed. The story lifecycle rule follows the choice and the app offers to add or update it in each project AI-DLC memory."
